      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BLACK CHIP (1) lines up chasing another win after scoring over 530m at this track in 30.83, set up by a fast early sectional. Can measure up again. JAN HEWETT (2) is generally an honest type in the frame at 30 of 64 starts but missed the placings last time when seventh (31.06) over 530m at this track. Has a good record here at this journey. Looks suited and expected to run well. TRIO OF CLOWNS (8) boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten 1.5 lengths (30.94) behind Zeberiah at this track. Boasts a strong record from this draw with three wins and two minor placings from six starts. Expected to be in this for a long way. PRIME VOLTAGE (5) found the frame here last start and looks a top-three hope again.",
